      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calumet%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Calumet officially incorporated in 1942 specifically so the town could construct a water system.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calumet%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before incorporating, Calumet existed as an unincorporated community with a post office, general stores, and combination mills.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calumet%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Calumet lies on the border of the Red Bed Plains and Gypsum Hills ecoregions of Oklahoma.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
